### Test output ###
# Everything the run produces already sits under target/, which is ignored above:
#   target/extent-report/  index.html + screenshots/ videos/ traces/
#   target/logs/           automation.log
#   target/video-raw/      Playwright's scratch folder for recordings
#   target/surefire-reports/
# Listed here only so it is obvious that no evidence is ever committed.

